sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Laptop (linked)
  participant R as Relay
  participant B as Phone (new)

  Note over A,B: the rendezvous is closed, the socket stays open
  B->>R: relay-watch(group)
  R->>A: peer introduced
  R->>B: peer introduced
  A->>B: keyhive ops + sealed document keys
  B->>B: reachableDocs() → doc ids → Home
  A->>B: automerge sync — encrypted content
